        <div class="fji-faq-item"><div class="fji-faq-q" onclick="fjiFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Fujiiryoki massage chairs in person?</h3><svg class="fji-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="fji-faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries Fujiiryoki models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and our Pleasanton location at Stoneridge Shopping Center. We strongly recommend trying Fujiiryoki in person before purchasing. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your visit here.</a></p></div></div>
        <div class="fji-faq-item"><div class="fji-faq-q" onclick="fjiFaq(this)"><h3>Where can I buy authentic Fujiiryoki massage chairs?</h3><svg class="fji-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="fji-faq-a"><p>House of Massage Chairs is an authorized Fujiiryoki dealer with showrooms in San Jose and Pleasanton, CA. Buying from an authorized specialist ensures genuine Fujiiryoki products, valid manufacturer warranties, professional white-glove delivery and setup, and specialist post-purchase support.</p></div></div>
        <div class="fji-faq-item"><div class="fji-faq-q" onclick="fjiFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between Fujiiryoki models?</h3><svg class="fji-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="fji-faq-a"><p>The MR-6000 Calm Plus is the accessible entry. The Cyber Relax Elite is the core Cyber Relax experience. The Cyber Relax Pro 4D Dual adds a 4D dual mechanism for broader, more assertive coverage. The Cyber Relax Ai adds AI-guided body scanning for adaptive precision. Each model has a clear purpose &mdash; no filler.</p></div></div>
        <div class="fji-faq-item"><div class="fji-faq-q" onclick="fjiFaq(this)"><h3>Do Fujiiryoki chairs come with warranty?</h3><svg class="fji-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="fji-faq-a"><p>Yes. Fujiiryoki massage chairs include manufacturer-backed warranties covering parts, labor, and structural frame. HOMC assists with all warranty coordination on your behalf &mdash; you do not navigate that process alone.</p></div></div>
        <div class="fji-faq-item"><div class="fji-faq-q" onclick="fjiFaq(this)"><h3>Is Fujiiryoki a good brand compared with competitors?</h3><svg class="fji-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="fji-faq-a"><p>Yes &mdash; Fujiiryoki is a highly credible premium Japanese massage chair brand with genuine engineering heritage. Compared with feature-dense brands, Fujiiryoki prioritizes precision and quality of feel over volume of features. For buyers who align with that philosophy, Fujiiryoki is one of the best choices in the premium segment.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

